  "body": "In cc5fa75c35354f7438327bbd816a2adf054a9379 the `disabled` IDL attribute was removed from `HTMLStyleElement` and `HTMLLinkElement`.  Maybe the intention was that CSSOM would define those, but it doesn't.  (CSSOM _does_ define `disabled` for `StyleSheet`, but not on elements.)\n",
